00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:04,540
He knows your circumstances.

264
00:19:04,540 --> 00:19:05,920
He knows what you're going through.

265
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:07,700
He knows where you're suffering.

266
00:19:07,700 --> 00:19:08,860
He knows where you're rebelling.

267
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:12,600
He knows where you're missing the mark.

268
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:14,520
He knows where you're hiding.

269
00:19:14,520 --> 00:19:19,060
