00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:21,040
He knows where we're successful.

271
00:19:21,040 --> 00:19:23,800
He knows where our shortcomings are.

272
00:19:23,900 --> 00:19:27,700
And he speaks to us in the middle of where we are presently.

273
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:29,760
He wants to encourage us, challenge us, rebuke us.

274
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:32,600
He wants to keep us moving forward in obedience.

275
00:19:32,600 --> 00:19:36,880
The Jesus that is presently risen and reigning, he knows you.

276
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:37,760
He knows us.

277
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:40,820
And he has a word for us by his spirit through the Scriptures.

278
00:19:40,820 --> 00:19:46,880
All right, so that's who Jesus is in Revelation 1 and 2.

279
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:51,720
Now, we want to better understand kind of how we should view ourselves as the church

