00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:55,420
in this present reality with the curtain being torn back.

281
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:57,020
Like, what are we to Jesus?

282
00:19:57,020 --> 00:19:58,040
How do we function?

283
00:19:58,040 --> 00:20:00,020
What is our relationship to him?

