Revelation 2, verse 8.

294
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:31,260
Write to the angel of the church in Smyrna.

295
00:20:31,260 --> 00:20:36,460
Thus says the first and the last, the one who was dead and came to life.

296
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:43,320
I know your affliction and your poverty, but you are rich.

297
00:20:43,320 --> 00:20:49,220
I know the slander of those who say they are Jews and are not, but are a synagogue of Satan.

298
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:51,820
Do not be afraid of what you are about to suffer.

299
00:20:51,820 --> 00:20:58,760
Look, the devil is about to throw some of you into prison to test you, and you will experience affliction for 10 days.

300
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:03,420
Be faithful to the point of death, and I will give you the crown of life.

301
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:13,740
Let anyone who has ears to listen to what the Spirit says to the churches, the one who conquers, will never be harmed by the second death.

302
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:22,160
So again, before we get too focused on the overarching challenges facing the specific churches, I want to look at this repeated form.

303
00:21:22,160 --> 00:21:25,740
Every single message follows this same form.

304
00:21:25,740 --> 00:21:29,320
Jesus repeats this seven times, and that's symbolic and for a reason.

305
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:30,380
He says,

306
00:21:30,520 --> 00:21:43,380
To the church of, fill in the blank, Ephesus, Smyrna, Thyatira, Laodicea, to the church of, thus says, thus says, write to the angel of the church, thus says, and then a title of Jesus.

307
00:21:43,380 --> 00:21:47,760
And each title, again, is contextualized to the situation of the churches.

308
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:54,580
To Smyrna, this is a church that is suffering and being persecuted, and some of them are being martyred.

309
00:21:54,580 --> 00:22:01,520
And so the title that he gives the church of Smyrna is, he says, thus says, the first and the last, the one who was dead and came back to life.

310
00:22:01,520 --> 00:22:08,520
He's speaking tenderly to a church who is watching some of their members being killed for the sake of Jesus.

311
00:22:08,520 --> 00:22:15,380
And he says, thus says, the one who was dead and raised back to life.

312
00:22:15,740 --> 00:22:22,740
He's immediately trying to encourage this church who is suffering, don't, don't be overcome by your suffering.

313
00:22:22,740 --> 00:22:27,780
I suffered and I rose, and just as I rose, you will rise with me.

314
00:22:27,780 --> 00:22:29,100
It's a message of hope.

315
00:22:29,100 --> 00:22:35,920
Thus says, a title, a contextualized title, and then there's going to be commendation of faithfulness.

316
00:22:36,940 --> 00:22:42,800
So to the church of, special title, here's what you're doing well, minus two churches.

317
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:44,680
Two churches don't really get any encouragement.

